pened on July 13th.&nbsp; As of July 20th, we have 150 completed entry forms and payments, therefore we are full.&nbsp;&nbsp;Thank you for your entries<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>The first 150 entry forms for which we have received the entry fee now have a receipt number and are showing on the the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.rallies.info\/webentry\/2026\/hillsford\/entries?type=u\">unseeded entry list<\/a><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Entry forms that do not have a corresponding payment will not be visible on the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rallies.info\/webentry\/2026\/hillsford\/entries?type=u\">unseeded entry list<\/a><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you need to make updates because you missed a few of the finer details in the rush, then please use the blue link in your receipt email &#39;Access Your Entry Home Page&#39;<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><u><strong>Reserve List<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are now operating a reserve list as shown below, these are in order of receipt of both completed entry form and payment and will be promoted to the unseeded list when or if a crew on the unseeded list withdraw.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>362 Allery Bonner<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>363 Gough Edwards<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>364 Faulkner Nicholls<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>365 Turner Morris<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>366 Crawford Beamond<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>367 Black Morton<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>368 Price Hands<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>369 Taylor Lewis<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>370 MacCrone Riddick<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>372 Morris Rees<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>373&nbsp; Pinder Jode<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>374 Rogerson Owen<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Check out the competitor&#39;s&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/webapp.sportity.com\/channel\/HFS26Comp\">Sportity channel HFS26Comp<\/a><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>All the information you need about the event, including SRs, schedule, entry form, final instructions and bulletins on the weekend will be made available on Sportity over the upcoming months so register with the event password HFS26Comp as soon as you can to get all the necessary details.&nbsp; If you prefer to access via the web rather than the app, <a href=\"https:\/\/webapp.sportity.com\/channel\/HFS26Comp\">use this URL<\/a>&nbsp; We recommend you use the app so that you receive notifications of important messages before and during the event, if you only use the web version you will need to regularly check the channel for updates.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sportity app can be downloaded from your usual play store or apple store.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>General information about the event is available on the <a href=\"https:\/\/hillsfordstages.co.uk\/\">website<\/a>.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>Questions about entering the event can be directed to entry@cheltmc.com<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>We look forward to seeing you at our new home in Shropshire in September.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n"},{"ra_eventid":"jerseytrial1026","name":"Jersey 20th September 2026  - Trial","url":"\/webentry\/2026\/jersey\/trial10","ra_entriesopen":"13 Sep at 07:00","willopen":"1","ra_seeded":"1","ra_unseeded":"1","ra_date":"2026-09-20","date_short":"20 Sep","canenter":"0","ev_id":null,"website":"www.jerseymotorsport.com","ev_cluburl":null,"ev_eventstart":null,"ev_eventfinish_short":null,"description":"A trial held on Jersey","clublogo":"\/webentry\/clublogos\/jerseynov2821.png","ra_noticeboard":null},{"ra_eventid":"trackrodhist26","name":"Trackrod Historic Cup 2026","url":"\/webentry\/2026\/trackrodhistoric","ra_entriesopen":"07 Aug at 19:00","willopen":"0","ra_seeded":"0","ra_unseeded":"1","ra_date":"2026-09-25","date_short":"25 Sep","canenter":"1","ev_id":null,"website":"www.rallyyorkshire.co.uk","ev_cluburl":null,"ev_eventstart":null,"ev_eventfinish_short":null,"description":"A round of the BHRC championship based in Filey and held in the forests of North Yorkshire","clublogo":"\/webentry\/clublogos\/trackrodhist26.png","ra_noticeboard":null},{"ra_eventid":"trackrodmini26","name":"Trackrod MINI Challenge 2026","url":"\/webentry\/2026\/trackrodmini","ra_entriesopen":"07 Aug at 19:00",